Package: invoice-desk
Version: @VERSION@
Architecture: amd64
Maintainer: Omar Maarouf <omarmaarouf18@users.noreply.github.com>
Installed-Size: @SIZE@
Depends: @DEPENDS@
Recommends: libnotify-bin, xdg-utils
Section: misc
Priority: optional
Homepage: https://github.com/omarmaarouf18/invoice-desk
Description: Bilingual (Arabic/English) desktop invoicing for freelancers
 Invoice Desk keeps every client, invoice, contract and quote in one offline
 SQLite database, with an Arabic right-to-left or English interface,
 bilingual documents and vector A4 PDF export.
 .
 User data lives in the home directory and is never touched by installing,
 upgrading or removing this package.
